        "question_text": "<p>In a manual transmission vehicle, what is the primary function of the <b>clutch disc</b>?</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The <b>clutch disc</b> is the component that transmits engine torque to the transmission input shaft. It is sandwiched between the flywheel and the pressure plate and uses friction material to engage and disengage the engine from the drivetrain.</p>",
